# The Vercel deployment is the STATIC dashboard (outputDirectory: dashboard) plus the
# Node functions in api/ (today: api/screen-builder.js, the AI screen builder). Keep the
# Python engine, data, and tooling out of the upload so Vercel never tries to build
# Python. Do NOT add api/ or dashboard/ here: api/screen-builder.js requires
# dashboard/screen-dsl.js and dashboard/screen_fields.json at runtime
# (scripts/test_screen_builder.js checks this file).
engine/
scripts/
data/
tests/
supabase/
.github/
.venv/
__pycache__/
requirements.txt
.env
.env.*
*.db
*.log
README.md
